          "logprobs": [],
          "text": "Do you mean **callbacks from job applications, after interviews or auditions, or something else?** I don’t want to guess and give you the wrong advice.\n\nIf you mean job applications, possible reasons include a résumé that doesn’t clearly show your fit, a mismatch with the roles’ requirements, or hiring circumstances outside your control—not necessarily a lack of ability. ([cdo.som.yale.edu](https://cdo.som.yale.edu/blog/2025/03/21/why-am-i-not-getting-interviews-heres-what-might-be-going-wrong/?utm_source=openai))\n\nTell me what you’re applying for, roughly how many applications you’ve sent and over what timeframe, and whether you’re getting any initial interviews. You can also paste your résumé and a typical job posting, with personal details removed, so we can look for specific issues."
        }
